      "text": "The medusa fixes their glare at a creature they can see within 30 feet. The target must immediately attempt a DC 38 Fortitude save save against the medusa's petrifying gaze. If the creature was already Slowed by petrifying gaze before attempting its save, a failed save causes it to be Petrified permanently.\n\nAfter attempting its save, the creature is then temporarily immune until the start of the medusa's next turn."
